What is a Wardrobe App?
Wardrobe apps are digital closet solutions that enable users to capture images of their garments, tag attributes such as brand, colour, fabric and style, and organise outfits through AI driven recommendations, weather aware planning and direct e commerce integration. By turning a personal wardrobe into a searchable, data rich inventory, these platforms help consumers reduce decision fatigue, optimise garment utilisation and make more environmentally conscious purchase decisions.
